/ The large search field of a page's hero, with the navbar typeahead and a few
/ example searches. The page sets @hero_search so the navbar leaves its own out.
/ value fills in the field, examples: false leaves out the example searches.
= form_tag search_path, method: :get do
  label.form-label.fw-semibold for='hero-search'= label
  .input-group.input-group-lg
    = search_field_tag :q, local_assigns[:value], id: 'hero-search', class: 'form-control form-control-lg search-input',
        placeholder: 'Straße, Stadtteil, Thema oder Drucksachen-Nr.', data: search_input_data, autocomplete: 'off'
    button.btn.btn-primary type='submit' Suchen
- if local_assigns.fetch(:examples, true)
  = render 'search/examples', css: 'mt-3'
